wsa (3.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release.
  * Manual and automated assessment flows for OPEN, WEP, WPA-Personal,
    WPA3, and WPA-Enterprise networks.
  * Rogue-side handshake filtering — mask and wordlist attacks only
    run against material that can produce a real target recovery.
  * NIST SP 800-53 remediation reporting with per-report family legend.
  * Teaching-grade methodology reference with peer-reviewed citations
    for each protocol.
  * Multi-layer connectivity test for OPEN flow (ip / gw / icmp / http)
    instead of ICMP-only, eliminating false negatives on guest APs that
    block ICMP but permit HTTP.

